<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech 1996 avg nominal gross wages up 18.0 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Czech 1996 avg nominal gross wages up 18.0 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech Republic's average nominal gross wage in the fourth quarter grew 17.1 percent year-on-year, or up 18.0 percent for the entire year, the Czech Statistical Bureau (CSU) said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
